      frequencies of the AFNOR corpus (half formal, half informal text,
      <a href="/en/comparison#methode-comparatif">method</a>), the share of keystrokes affected is
      1.01%: in ordinary text, 99% of keystrokes are identical to those of the
      traditional AZERTY you know.</p>
    </div>

